      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An impressive and conveniently located two storey end terrace house within a short walk of all local amenities. The property is situated in a mature residential area and has the benefit of two off street parking spaces to the front and an enclosed rear garden with side pedestrian access. The accommodation comprises of Entrance Porch, open plan Living/Kitchen area, Dining room, WC, Shower room and three bedrooms. Upvc windows and doors. Dual central heating system, oil fired and solid fuel. Mains Services. \n\nOutside: There is an enclosed rear garden in lawn. Cladded storage shed. \n\n\nEntrance Porch - 2m (6'7) x 1m (3'3)\nCarpet flooring\n\nKitchen/Living Room - 3.95m (13'0) x 6.5m (21'4)\nFitted kitchen, Electric Cooker, Extractor hood, Hot press, Wood flooring, solid fuel insert boiler stove.\n\nDining Room - 3.6m (11'10) x 3m (9'10)\nWood flooring\n\nWC - 2m (6'7) x 1m (3'3)\nWHB, WC, Tiled.\n\nShower Room - 2.2m (7'3) x 1m (3'3)\nWHB, Pump shower unit, Fully tiled.\n\nFIRST FLOOR\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.8m (12'6) x 3m (9'10)\nWood flooring, Fitted Wardrobe\n\nBedroom 2 - 3m (9'10) x 2.4m (7'10)\nWood flooring\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.5m (8'2) x 2.2m (7'3)\nWood flooring\n\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
